#: ../../source/3.4SDK_Callback.md:1
msgid "3.4 SDK Callback"
msgstr "3.4 Callback参考"

#: ../../source/3.4SDK_Callback.md:4
msgid ""
"This document defines the data callback and control command callback "
"interfaces in the Robot SDK.   Namespace: `robot_sdk`"
msgstr "本文档定义了机器人 SDK 中的数据回调与控制命令回调接口。  <br>命名空间：`robot_sdk`"

#: ../../source/3.4SDK_Callback.md:9
msgid "Interface Overview"
msgstr "接口概览"

#: ../../source/3.4SDK_Callback.md:11
msgid "[`IDataCallback`](#idatacallback): Data reporting callback interface"
msgstr "[`IDataCallback`](#idatacallback)：数据上报回调接口  "

#: ../../source/3.4SDK_Callback.md:12
msgid ""
"[`IControlCallback`](#icontrolcallback): Control command callback "
"interface (non-blocking mode)"
msgstr "[`IControlCallback`](#icontrolcallback)：控制命令回调接口（非阻塞模式）"

#: ../../source/3.4SDK_Callback.md:17
msgid "IDataCallback"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/3.4SDK_Callback.md:19
msgid ""
"Users need to implement this interface as required to receive data from "
"the robot system."
msgstr "用户需根据需要实现此接口以接收来自机器人系统的数据。"

#: ../../source/3.4SDK_Callback.md:21
msgid ""
"⚠️ Callback functions must be **lightweight** and cannot perform time-"
"consuming operations.   In callback functions, it is recommended to "
"perform only fast operations such as data copying and validation.   If "
"time-consuming tasks need to be performed (such as database writes, file "
"I/O, complex calculations, network transmission, etc.), please **copy the"
" data to an independent thread or thread pool** within the callback "
"function for processing."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ 回调函数必须**轻量级**，不能执行耗时操作。 <br>"
"在回调函数中仅建议进行数据复制、校验等快速操作。 <br>"
"若需执行耗时任务（如数据库写入、文件I/O、复杂计算、网络发送等），请在回调函数内部**将数据复制到独立线程或线程池中**处理。"

